DATH Enrollment API acceptance tests (Issue #8)

→ Unauthenticated enrollment list is rejected
  GET http://localhost:5000/api/enrollments/me [401 Unauthorized, 1.11kB, 105ms]
  ✓  enrollment list requires authentication

→ Student login
  POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login [200 OK, 1.61kB, 485ms]
  ✓  student login succeeds

→ Enroll in published course
  POST http://localhost:5000/api/courses/4caa0810-89db-42a5-8951-3583de9a6d67/enroll [201 Created, 1.55kB, 67ms]
  ✓  enrollment is created

→ List my enrollments
  GET http://localhost:5000/api/enrollments/me [200 OK, 2.43kB, 73ms]
  ✓  my enrollments include the selected course

→ List my courses grouped by status
  GET http://localhost:5000/api/enrollments/my-courses [200 OK, 6.53kB, 23ms]
  ✓  my courses response separates active and completed courses

→ Update lesson progress
  POST http://localhost:5000/api/lessons/73583c33-d646-4b39-bfd7-3010e185bdcf/progress [200 OK, 1.89kB, 79ms]
  ✓  progress is saved and enrollment summary is returned

→ Reject invalid playback position
  POST http://localhost:5000/api/lessons/73583c33-d646-4b39-bfd7-3010e185bdcf/progress [400 Bad Request, 1.07kB, 11ms]
  ✓  negative playback position is rejected

→ Get resume lesson
  GET http://localhost:5000/api/enrollments/resume?courseId=4caa0810-89db-42a5-8951-3583de9a6d67 [200 OK, 1.41kB, 16ms]
  ✓  resume response points to the last lesson

→ Leave course
  DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/courses/4caa0810-89db-42a5-8951-3583de9a6d67/enroll [200 OK, 1.57kB, 19ms]
  ✓  student can leave course

→ Progress update is blocked after leaving
  POST http://localhost:5000/api/lessons/73583c33-d646-4b39-bfd7-3010e185bdcf/progress [403 Forbidden, 1.09kB, 19ms]
  ✓  non-enrolled student cannot update progress

